  DisplayName: Broken Tusk Recruiter
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Your gifted tongue, friendly demeanor, and deep knowledge of Broken
    Tusk culture and traditions make you an ideal recruiter for new followers. Whenever
    Broken Tusks come upon weak, weary, or wandering souls, you're often the first
    sent to meet these folks and determine if they would be a good fit for the following.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Hillcross
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Impression]
    skill feat.
